WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.770
The year is 2205 A.D.

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:13.400
To annihilate the History Retrograde Army,
who scheme to alter history,

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.660
we, who were born from swords...

00:00:20.370 --> 00:00:23.040
...engage in mortal combat today as well!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:47.770
"Touken Ranbu Hanamaru S2"

00:01:56.420 --> 00:01:57.800
Master!

00:01:57.800 --> 00:02:00.160
We brought dinner!

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.950
May we join you?

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:09.190
"This anime is about the
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:02:09.190 --> 00:02:14.270
of a certain group of
Sword Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:39.600
I got it!

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:41.970
It's so big!

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:43.300
Looks good!

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.060
As expected of Otegine!

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.140
It'd be great if there was saké, too!

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:50.520
I won't lose to anyone
when it comes to stabbing.

00:02:50.520 --> 00:02:51.800
Wait a minute!

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.150
Why...

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:57.820
Why are you all making
yourselves comfortable?

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.910
"That Morning"

00:02:59.740 --> 00:03:01.910
The weather's nice today, isn't it?

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:04.950
It's warm, even though it's already fall.

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.490
A day like this makes me want to go fishing.

00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:10.830
We can get delicious saury at this time of year.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:12.290
That sounds good!

00:03:12.290 --> 00:03:14.000
I want to go, too.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:20.170
But if we go by ourselves, then our big brothers
and those at the citadel will probably worry.

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:21.720
We're done, we're done!

00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:24.930
Fieldwork is pretty hard labor, huh?

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:32.520
"Otegine"

00:03:25.180 --> 00:03:30.310
After doing hard labor, I wanna drink
saké and have some delicious fish.

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.560
That sounds good.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.710
It's fine to dream, isn't it?

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.080
Ichi-<i>nii</i>, you're so mean!

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:43.410
Whoops.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:44.980
Hey, Houchou!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:48.700
Quarreling with your brother?

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:49.870
How unusual.

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.670
I'm embarrassed you had to see that...

00:03:52.670 --> 00:03:55.830
Houchou will be back once he's calmed down.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.030
Thank you for your concern.

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.010
We'll have salt-grilled
saury tonight for dinner!

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:06.760
Sounds good! It'll go great with hot saké, too!

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.510
Huh?

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.170
Houchou!

00:04:10.220 --> 00:04:11.640
What's the matter?

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.810
Ichi-<i>nii'</i>s a fathead, so I ran away from home.

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:17.360
What? What happened?

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:20.970
Hey, wanna come with us for a change of pace?

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:29.740
We're not catching anything!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.200
Well, there are days like that, too.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.360
Besides, we've only been
fishing for about an hour.

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.340
Otegine and Nihongou are both sleeping, too.

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.880
They've been working
the fields since this morning,

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.920
and it's nice and warm today.

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:46.970
I think I'm getting kind of sleepy, too...

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:11.930
Where... are we...?!

00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:16.920
It's already morning,
and they still haven't come home!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:21.090
Calm down. The situation
won't change even if you panic.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.630
Did they come back?

00:05:22.630 --> 00:05:23.840
Did he come here?

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:25.550
No, not yet.

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:30.050
We searched by the ocean all night,
but no one was there.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:33.520
My younger brothers and
I searched the mountains, too...

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:41.690
There's no question that Otegine and
the others went fishing yesterday, right?

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:43.730
That's what I heard.

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:46.330
But where could Houchou have gone?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:48.740
I'll go look again.

00:05:49.030 --> 00:05:52.280
Wait, wait. Aren't you tired
from searching this whole time?

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:55.500
Why don't you take a break
with your brothers first?

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:56.750
But...

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.460
We had Master look into it!

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:02.210
All six are together!

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:04.960
Really? Even Houchou?

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:09.470
Yeah. Master said not to
worry because everyone is all right.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.430
I'm so glad...

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:14.180
Also, they probably aren't very far away.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:17.730
But Master doesn't know
exactly where they are.

00:06:17.730 --> 00:06:18.890
I see...

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.860
But even if Otegine
and the others went fishing,

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:24.420
why didn't Houchou come back?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.700
I scolded him too harshly.

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.740
"Feminine Wives"

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.740
Hey, Houchou.

00:06:33.160 --> 00:06:35.540
Aren't I always telling you
that if you eat so many snacks,

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:38.330
then you won't be able to eat dinner?

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:41.250
That's all you've been
saying recently, Ichi-<i>nii</i>.

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:46.060
A married woman would kindly tell me
that I could eat as much as I wanted.

00:06:47.460 --> 00:06:51.550
No married woman would come to this citadel!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:59.350
If only I hadn't been so harsh with him...

00:07:01.350 --> 00:07:04.820
W-Well, isn't it great that it
sounds like everyone's okay?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:05.680
Hey, look.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.580
Could that be...?

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.030
Kuniyuki! Are you going to look for them?

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.790
It'll be bad if we miss each other,
so Hotarumaru, you stay at the citadel.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:21.250
But you haven't slept this whole time,
either, have you, Kuniyuki?

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.000
Will you be okay?

00:07:23.380 --> 00:07:25.500
This is nothing.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.960
If you're going to look
for them, then I will go, too.

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:28.670
I will also--

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:30.260
A fake should stay.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:34.490
I've been waiting at the citadel,
so I still have stamina left.

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.810
So, I will go this time.

00:07:39.930 --> 00:07:41.940
Very well. I leave it to you, then.

00:07:42.770 --> 00:07:44.520
I will go search for them, too.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:45.270
But...

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:48.860
I'm so worried, I can't sit still.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:51.030
I'll tire myself out more if I stay.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.690
I will also accompany you.

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.740
I'm sure I can be of use somehow.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.450
Everyone, be careful out there.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.660
Oh, right. If you're
going out to look for them...

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.630
I understand.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.760
A swallow is a symbol of luck.

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:14.300
It will definitely bring you all good luck.

00:08:15.840 --> 00:08:17.300
They're cooked!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:20.100
Here you go!

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.680
Thank you very much!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.980
Delish!

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.650
It's the best!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:25.960
Hey, wait!

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:29.400
Aren't you all getting too
comfortable with this situation?

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:33.530
But we don't know where we should head.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:37.280
Even from the citadel, they'll be
able to figure out where we are,

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:39.410
so someone'll come for us eventually.

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:42.660
But we don't know how long it'll take.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:45.420
So we should arrange things in
our environment the best we can.

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:50.670
Houchou! When we finish eating,
let's build a house with Nihongou-<i>san</i>!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:55.260
What? If I don't have a reward waiting, like
getting a pat on the head by a married woman,

00:08:55.260 --> 00:08:57.140
then I don't feel like doing anything.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:09:00.100
That's all you've been
saying since you got here.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:03.770
Isn't that why Ichigo Hitofuri scolded you?

00:09:03.770 --> 00:09:06.310
Ichi<i>-nii</i> has nothing to do
with what's going on now, does he?

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.110
And I'm sure he feels relieved that I'm gone.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:11.740
He doesn't have to get mad anymore.

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.610
Monoyoshi, is this really the right path?

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:17.360
Yes.

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:19.830
My intuition is telling me so.

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.290
Is this <i>really</i> the right path?

00:09:25.290 --> 00:09:26.790
Yes, this way please.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:30.000
Good fortune lies up ahead.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.210
Is this... a cave...?

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.340
It looks very deep...

00:09:37.340 --> 00:09:39.930
I didn't know there was a place like this...

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.480
There's no evidence that
anyone's been here before, either.

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:49.310
Hey, are you sure we're going the right way?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.110
Yes, this way please.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:55.030
Right now, we have no choice but
to trust Monoyoshi and move forward.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:56.360
You're right.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:58.740
If something comes out, I'll chase it away.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:00.530
Now, here we go!

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:08.170
It's getting chilly, so let's go by the bonfire.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.420
I'm fine...

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.460
I think Ichi-<i>nii'</i>s really
worried about you, too, Houchou.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:18.550
No, he's not. I always make him mad.

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:22.010
That's because he cares for you.

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:31.440
I think it's really hard for the
kind Ichi-<i>nii</i> to get mad at someone.

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.690
But I think it's because

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:38.070
he wants you to be able to get
along better with everyone at the citadel

00:10:38.070 --> 00:10:39.420
that he does it.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:45.890
Of my previous masters, there were those
who were always alone in their later years.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:48.250
No one ever got mad at them.

00:10:48.620 --> 00:10:53.210
But I think that's the same
as time being stopped.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.960
They couldn't change or grow.

00:10:57.970 --> 00:11:01.430
So let's work hard so Ichi-<i>nii</i> will praise us.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.600
I know this is hard,

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:07.230
but let's do our best so we can be
proud when we go back to the citadel.

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:12.860
All right. I'll do it.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.660
We finally got out of there...

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:33.350
Food tastes great after working hard!

00:11:36.380 --> 00:11:37.550
It's good!

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:39.340
It's 'cause <i>I</i> caught that fish!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.810
Urashima!

00:11:42.430 --> 00:11:44.600
Hachisuka... <i>niichan</i>!

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:46.350
I was so worried!

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:47.560
I'm sorry!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:51.310
Oh, did you all come for us?

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:52.520
Yeah.

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:56.480
But we were shipwrecked.
Why do you guys look more beat up than us?

00:11:56.650 --> 00:12:00.650
This place is past the
mountain behind the citadel,

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:03.160
and the path was pretty steep and rugged.

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:06.450
I think it was probably
the shortest route here.

00:12:06.740 --> 00:12:09.950
But anyway, I'm glad you're all okay.

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:14.290
I didn't think there was a cave
like that near the citadel, though.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.460
I'll have to report it
to Master once we get back.

00:12:17.210 --> 00:12:18.840
Now, let's go back.

00:12:18.840 --> 00:12:20.090
Are you all right?

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.300
It's completely black under your eyes.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:24.590
I got dirty coming here.

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.120
Sorry for worrying you.

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:29.850
Thanks for coming to get me!

00:12:31.180 --> 00:12:32.590
I'm just glad you're okay.

00:12:38.400 --> 00:12:41.060
Come on, let's go.

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.180
Ichi-<i>nii</i>!

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.380
Let's go home.

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:58.840
Ichi-<i>nii</i>!

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.920
I'm sorry for saying mean things!

00:13:02.170 --> 00:13:04.150
I was also too harsh on you.

00:13:04.720 --> 00:13:05.730
I'm sorry.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.060
I'm glad... I'm really glad you're both okay.

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:12.350
I'm sorry for making you worry.

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:15.100
But we were with everyone else,
so we were fine.

00:13:15.980 --> 00:13:19.230
Now, let's go home. Everyone's waiting.

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:29.240
Did Houchou cause any
problems acting selfish or anything?

00:13:29.240 --> 00:13:30.760
Not at all.

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:34.000
Houchou did his best in his own way.

00:13:34.000 --> 00:13:36.030
Please praise him when he wakes up.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:37.780
I will.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:40.210
We're back!

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:44.550
Even though we were only
gone for a day, I already missed it.

00:13:44.550 --> 00:13:47.470
All right! Time for a drink
to celebrate returning safely!

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.640
I will sleep for a very long time now...

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:52.560
I'm home!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:02.690
Here. Three special miso ramen are ready.

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:05.150
Wow, looks delicious!

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.110
This is ready, too.

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:10.070
Shrimp and chive dumplings.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.160
This looks good, too!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:14.580
I'm sure my brother will be happy, too.

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:18.290
Shokudaikiri-<i>san</i>, Kasen-<i>san</i>,
thank you very much.

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:22.120
It's chilly today, so that's why
we decided to make hot ramen.

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:26.760
I hope he will be able
to eat with everyone soon.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:28.050
Yes!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:39.310
Oodenta-<i>san</i>, here's the food.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:42.270
I'm sorry to always
put you through this trouble.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.480
Now, let's eat before the noodles get soggy.

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:47.950
Thanks for the food!

00:14:51.240 --> 00:14:52.950
This ramen is delicious.

00:14:53.280 --> 00:14:55.660
The dumplings are good, too.

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:58.160
Yes. They are both good.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.470
Um, Oodenta-<i>san</i>.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:02.380
Hm?

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:03.450
Would you like...

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:06.510
...to eat with everyone else?

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:10.010
It makes me happy to be invited,

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:12.560
but my spiritual power is too strong.

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:18.060
I don't want to carelessly leave
my room and scare the animals.

00:15:20.560 --> 00:15:24.990
I am a spiritual sword said to cure sickness
just by being laid by someone's pillow.

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:30.450
However, animals fear that
spiritual power and will not come near me.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:34.970
Monsters and sickness fear me,
but no one will associate with me.

00:15:35.780 --> 00:15:37.600
At any rate, that's just
the kind of sword I am.

00:15:38.950 --> 00:15:41.210
You should also leave this place quickly

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.710
so that you are not exposed
to my spiritual power.

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:55.430
Thanks for the food,
Shokudaikiri-<i>san</i>, Kasen-<i>san</i>.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.640
The lunch was really delicious!

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.350
My brother was happy, too.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.900
It makes the effort worth it when I hear that.

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:06.110
Do you think Oodenta-<i>san</i>
will ever come here to eat?

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:07.330
Well...

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.780
I see.

00:16:11.780 --> 00:16:17.280
Oodenta-<i>san</i> is worried about scaring
the animals with his spiritual power.

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.240
Yes...

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.990
If only there was a good way to fix that...

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:23.460
Thanks for the food.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:28.090
The ramen today was very delicious.

00:16:28.090 --> 00:16:28.970
Thanks.

00:16:29.510 --> 00:16:31.840
You can just leave the dishes in the sink.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.050
Very well.

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:37.260
Is his spiritual power
so strong that animals fear it?

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:41.230
So the legend goes,
but I don't really understand it.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.190
But when my brother's near animals,

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.980
I feel like he gets really nervous.

00:16:47.940 --> 00:16:49.860
Maybe that's the problem?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:52.410
He must be thinking of the animals.

00:16:52.860 --> 00:16:57.200
If he slowly comes into more contact
with animals, perhaps he'll get used to it.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:17:00.580
But how can we get him
more used to animals?

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:04.540
What if you prepare a place
where people can come touch animals?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:08.500
And then welcome Oodenta-<i>sama</i>
there with the animals.

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:11.670
I see. That's a good idea.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:12.680
It's true.

00:17:13.130 --> 00:17:14.930
Rather than teach him,
have him get used to it.

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.510
Let's go ask everyone for help right away.

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:19.470
Okay.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:22.770
Of course, we will also help.

00:17:22.770 --> 00:17:23.680
Yeah.

00:17:23.890 --> 00:17:26.850
Then, I will prepare
an open-air tea ceremony.

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:29.480
If we're going to welcome someone,
we must have tea.

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:31.570
Then, I'll make some snacks.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.940
I got some nice chestnuts yesterday,

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.160
so how about some chestnut <i>dorayaki</i>?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.110
Everyone, thank you very much!

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:42.960
Why are you bringing me out?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:46.370
I am a sword that should
be sealed away in storage.

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:49.840
There's something we wanted you to see.

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.050
Welcome to the animal café!

00:18:02.640 --> 00:18:07.560
Everyone planned this so that
you could get used to animals, Brother.

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:23.400
W-Well, anyway,
I will pour the tea, so have a seat.

00:18:45.470 --> 00:18:48.480
What's the matter?
Why are you in a place like this?

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:49.240
No reason.

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.300
Animals are good.

00:18:54.940 --> 00:18:56.740
They heal the heart.

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:58.450
Don't you agree?

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:00.280
Yeah...

00:19:07.830 --> 00:19:09.620
It's a strange texture.

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:13.340
Yeah. This guy likes to be petted.

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:14.590
Really?

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:20.010
Don't lick me so much.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:23.300
T-Tora-<i>kun</i>, don't be so naughty!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.810
Now, you too, Oodenta-<i>san</i>.

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:28.180
No... I'm...

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:28.970
Maeda...

00:19:29.730 --> 00:19:31.350
Do you know where Yagen is?

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:32.730
Is something the matter?

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:35.940
Actually, something seems
off with this little one.

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.900
Unfortunately, I can't
tell what's wrong myself.

00:19:40.070 --> 00:19:42.160
That is distressing.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:44.870
Yagen-<i>niisan</i> is on an expedition...

00:19:45.240 --> 00:19:46.450
I see...

00:19:53.250 --> 00:19:58.510
You said before that monsters and sickness
are afraid of you, right, Oodenta-<i>san</i>?

00:19:58.760 --> 00:20:02.010
Will you check to see what
is wrong with this tanuki?

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.010
I did say that,

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:08.820
but what if something happens when I,
who am feared by animals, touch it...

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.050
Are you not afraid of me?

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:23.660
If we don't do anything, it may
become a matter of life and death...

00:20:25.780 --> 00:20:27.530
Please, will you take a look?

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.170
Oodenta-<i>san</i>...

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.040
Why don't you take a look, Brother?

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:41.380
Very well.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:54.140
You should relax a little more.

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:58.320
If the animal feels your tenseness,
then it won't be able to calm down, either.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:20:59.750
You're right...

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:16.290
Apparently, this was causing the problem.

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.340
Thanks for your help.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.260
Isn't that great?

00:21:28.260 --> 00:21:29.180
Yeah.

00:21:31.270 --> 00:21:33.210
Oh, a swallow.

00:21:35.190 --> 00:21:35.940
Come here.

00:21:40.150 --> 00:21:41.440
Oodenta-<i>san</i>.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:42.270
Huh?

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:45.280
No, I'm...

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.120
Please don't be nervous.

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:53.610
Now, stick out your hand gently...

00:21:59.080 --> 00:22:01.250
See, it's fine, right?

00:22:03.010 --> 00:22:05.670
Isn't that great, Oodenta-<i>san</i>?

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:06.680
Yeah.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:24:01.590
"More <i>Hanamaru</i> Next Week!!"
